note ======== OM-2 words (spec/omegese-om2.md): reserved only in an OM-2 unit. rotr 59, rotl 60 are
note binary operators; the rest are statement and declaration words of later sections. ========
fn kw2 w ulong to ulong
if eq w 1920233330
ret 59
end
if eq w 1819570034
ret 60
end
if eq w 119212982038133
ret 181
end
if eq w 111524889521769
ret 182
end
if eq w 448612627046
ret 183
end
