bo_fix rd ty
end

note div, rem (om4 BO_DIV, BO_SDIV): CBZ Xb trap 2 unless fl bit 1 (b a number other than 0); UDIV or
note SDIV; rem: t = a / b, rd = a - t * b (MSUB); i64 div: CMN Xb, #1; B.NE +3; NEGS XZR, Xa; B.VS trap 1,
note unless fl bit 2 (b a number other than -1)
